is article as long as the work is properly cited, the use is educational and not for profit, and the work is not altered. See <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/3.0/">http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/3.0/</ext-link> for details.</license-p></license></permissions><self-uri xlink:title="pdf" xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="2872.pdf"/><counts><page-count count="1"/></counts></article-meta></front><body><p><bold>Cefalu WT, Hu FB. Role of chromium in human health and in diabetes. Diabetes Care 2004;27:<related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" id="d35e82" vol="36" page="2741" ext-link-type="pmc">2741&#x02013;2751</related-article></bold></p><p>In the article listed above, there is a typographical error in Fig. 3<italic>B</italic>. On the <italic>y</italic>-axis, the numbering should be 6, 8, 10, 12, 14 rather than 16, 18, 10, 12, 14.</p></body></article>